  triage:title "Fixed thread::sleep in reconcile_runtime.rs test code" ;
  triage:description "In crates/atm-daemon/src/reconcile_runtime.rs test section, line 452 uses std::thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(20)). Fixed sleeps in tests cause flaky failures on slow CI runners. Should use event-driven synchronization or bounded poll loop instead." ;
